      "fixture": "PART FAIL after A FIRST, first IRQ ELR 0x40201278 at part_a_begin, no second eret. Timeout after park. Unchanged partition.rs since a547ff1d. First trace lacks the counter samples and predicate ID necessary to diagnose timing versus other guards. No proof of source regression or configuration error.",
